    per turn. During the Main Phase: You can discard 1 card; add 1 "Gravekeeper''s"
    or EARTH Fairy monster from your Deck to your hand. During your opponent''s Draw
    Phase, before their normal draw, if this card is already face-up on the field:
    Declare 1 card name; look at the card(s) drawn for their normal draw, and if
    it was the declared card, send it to the GY.'
